            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"interpretation\">Interpretation</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">A <strong>3x3 minimum filter</strong> selects\nthe darkest value in each neighborhood. This suppresses isolated\nbright <strong>salt</strong> pixels, but also expands dark structures.</span></span>"
          }
        }
